{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "11e8e6e9-efc0-8dfa-b1a9-b9b994ddf2b9",
  "created_at": "2026-01-16T11:21:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kwame Goldberg",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:18:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:18:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, sorry to bother you. Is this the right number for water and sewer bills? I want to make sure I'm doing this right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:19:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you've got the right place. What's going on with your bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:19:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I'm at 130 Ocean Avenue, and the payment I sent from my bank bounced, apparently. I got a notice about it. I'm just trying to find out where that stands. Is it still showing unpaid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:19:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the account. Can you give me your name, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kwame Goldberg. G-O-L-D-B-E-R-G. Sorry, I should have said that first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:19:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Okay, I see it. The payment was returned by the bank, so right now that amount is still open on the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:19:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Well, that's what I figured. The thing is, the bill itself is way higher than it should be. Last year my winter bills were much lower. Like, half of this, easily. I don't know what changed, because nothing did on my end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:19:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can see the current reading and the charge. I can note your concern and have someone review the meter reading. Would you like me to put in that request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Sorry, is that something I need to do in writing, or is you noting it enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:20:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Me noting it is enough to start the review. They'll call you at the number on file. Is that still 401-555-0157?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:20:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I've added it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:20:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Um, and for the payment, I can't always get over there during the day. Is there a drop box at City Hall for payments after closing time? Or is it online only?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:20:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a payment drop box at City Hall you can use anytime. You can also pay online through the city website. Just put your account number or a copy of the bill in with a check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. And I should just use a different check, I'd guess, since that one bounced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:20:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, or pay online with a card if you'd rather. Either way, the returned payment will need to be covered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Sorry, one more thing, and you can tell me if that's not a fair question. Did you grow up around here? You sound like you know the area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did, actually. Born and raised in Newport."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:21:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's good to know. Well, then you know a bill like this is a lot for a winter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. The review should clear up whether the reading was right. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:21:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, and sorry again for taking your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:21:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. Have a good weekend, Mr. Goldberg."
    }
  ],
